# StonksSniper workstream index

Authority: user-requested application development and TODO/issue/Project registration.
Adoption: numbered local workstreams own managed issue bodies and completion.
Project: https://github.com/users/Zanark/projects/14
Mapping: tracking.json; NOT_STARTED/open/Todo, IN_PROGRESS/open/In Progress,
DONE/closed-completed/Done. Actual Project options were discovered, not invented.
Sync: scripts/sync_tracking.py previews by default; --apply is explicit.
Conflicts: stop on unexpected remote body, title, state or Project status changes.
Privacy: public-safe workstreams only; never export private context or raw data.
Excluded from feature issues: this index and the perpetual development ledger.

## Milestones

M1: native single-stock daily-data learning and deterministic simulation slice.
M1.1: ELI15-first explanations, DeepSeaFoam native design and screenshot gallery.
M1.2: independent date-range simulations with animated trades and final P&L.
M2: source qualification, broader catalogue and robust study/reproducibility.
M3: portfolio baskets and controlled AI hypothesis experiments.
M4: independently qualified optional data integrations and Windows distribution.

