Provider investigations each retain named option tasks plus the common
qualification contract in docs/data-providers.md. This register is extensible,
not a promise to enumerate every service in existence. Integration remains
read-only market data; account opening, purchases and real trading are excluded.

## Completion

M1 (SS-01 through SS-05): technically complete with representative real-data
checks and offscreen native inspection. Human acceptance is not recorded.
M1.1 (SS-19): technically complete. Seven explained rules and 74 authored dictionary entries,
not every possible strategy or an unlimited vocabulary.
M1.2 (SS-20): technically complete in source. Separate date-range playback shows
buy/sell markers, trade history and final INR/% P&L. Published v0.2.0 is unchanged.
SS-06 is IN_PROGRESS: 20 additional sourced daily strategies, ELI15 lessons and
guides extend the current source to 27 rules and 97 dictionary entries.
See docs/strategies.md for the complete 27-rule ELI15 reference, exact buy/sell/hold
conditions, formulas, examples, warmups and sources; wider research is unfinished.
SS-11 is IN_PROGRESS: the authorized v0.2.0 Windows executable is published,
with the missing-price regression fixed and actual Windows/Linux live CI passed.
Release: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/releases/tag/v0.2.0
Broader clean-machine, signing and human acceptance remain open.
SS-07 through SS-18 otherwise remain planned; no basket, AI or qualified-feed
completion is implied. The user authorized first-prototype commit, push and
release on 2026-11-11; publication does not complete the remaining roadmap.

Read each workstream for current status and its verified completion evidence.
Human acceptance and publication are separate from technical completion.
See 99_DEVELOPMENT_LEDGER.todo for the causal development record.
